(5847296, 851013, 10785, '<td valign="top">I personally think the woody thing is a bit overdone. It''s a great toy for personal figure studies and posing. Perhaps it would be great used as a part of a series. The picture on the other hand is very good. Such rich colors are hard to get with the white background. You got great exposure.</td>', 'I personally think the woody thing is a bit overdone. It''s a great toy for personal figure studies and posing. Perhaps it would be great used as a part of a series. The picture on the other hand is very good. Such rich colors are hard to get with the white background. You got great exposure.', '2010-02-01 11:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5847303, 850245, 10785, '<td valign="top">I''m not really in love with the composition. Using the portrait layout with all the negative space and horizontal subject cutting it in half does not really appeal to me. I think a diagonal rotation would have been much more interesting and appealing in this case. As far as the subject... lighting is ok. DoF is good as you can see the near and far range of focus. Good B&amp;W conversion with a decent range of tones.</td>', 'I''m not really in love with the composition. Using the portrait layout with all the negative space and horizontal subject cutting it in half does not really appeal to me. I think a diagonal rotation would have been much more interesting and appealing in this case. As far as the subject... lighting is ok. DoF is good as you can see the near and far range of focus. Good B&W conversion with a decent range of tones.', '2010-02-01 11:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5847306, 850728, 10785, '<td valign="top">Great texture shown with the hairy hand, chin and skin. The B&amp;W conversion is a little flat. There is a lot of dark shadow and the forground is somewhat too bright. I am noticing some pixelation along the edges of the fingers.</td>', 'Great texture shown with the hairy hand, chin and skin. The B&W conversion is a little flat. There is a lot of dark shadow and the forground is somewhat too bright. I am noticing some pixelation along the edges of the fingers.', '2010-02-01 11:31:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5847308, 850700, 10785, '<td valign="top">Superb subject! Great use of light and DoF to bring focus to the emerging hand. Love the textures shown.</td>', 'Superb subject! Great use of light and DoF to bring focus to the emerging hand. Love the textures shown.', '2010-02-01 11:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5847314, 851092, 10785, '<td valign="top">The title suggests movement but the picture is somewhat static. I do notice some dust rising and the footstep seems to be dug in a little which suggests a slight walk. If the foot was clearly in the walking position, the two would jive better. I do like how you have shown the musculature of the leg clearly depicting the human form.</td>', 'The title suggests movement but the picture is somewhat static. I do notice some dust rising and the footstep seems to be dug in a little which suggests a slight walk. If the foot was clearly in the walking position, the two would jive better. I do like how you have shown the musculature of the leg clearly depicting the human form.', '2010-02-01 11:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5847326, 850055, 10785, '<td valign="top">Superb subject! The photo conjures up emotions of humble joy. I think that happens due to a mix of the harsh shadows of the flash, the great textures of the skin combined with the title. Way to sneak in the much despised water drop in a very interesting way!</td>', 'Superb subject! The photo conjures up emotions of humble joy. I think that happens due to a mix of the harsh shadows of the flash, the great textures of the skin combined with the title. Way to sneak in the much despised water drop in a very interesting way!', '2010-02-01 11:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5847329, 850214, 10785, '<td valign="top">This would be a very nice keepsake for a family album depicting baby''s first baptism. All the white makes this soft and precious.</td>', 'This would be a very nice keepsake for a family album depicting baby''s first baptism. All the white makes this soft and precious.', '2010-02-01 11:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5847331, 850676, 10785, '<td valign="top">Very good photo. The rotation keeps this from being totaly static. Just get a smile on that face next time... They''re your future and your future should be bright!</td>', 'Very good photo. The rotation keeps this from being totaly static. Just get a smile on that face next time... They''re your future and your future should be bright!', '2010-02-01 11:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5847341, 851253, 10785, '<td valign="top">One of the great rules of composition is to get coser. I think you got too close here. What is lacking is some context to define the form I am looking at. I get that it is human from the skin and hair and I am looking at some kind of dinosaur tattoo... but it is lacking in form.</td>', 'One of the great rules of composition is to get coser. I think you got too close here. What is lacking is some context to define the form I am looking at. I get that it is human from the skin and hair and I am looking at some kind of dinosaur tattoo... but it is lacking in form.', '2010-02-01 11:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5847349, 851012, 10785, '<td valign="top">He seems to be pretty intense for looking at something immense! Great use of roation to create a more dynamic composition. I like the B&amp;W converison... not too dark or too light. Nice tonal ranges here. The textures stand out well and the focus is right on the eyes!</td>', 'He seems to be pretty intense for looking at something immense! Great use of roation to create a more dynamic composition. I like the B&W converison... not too dark or too light. Nice tonal ranges here. The textures stand out well and the focus is right on the eyes!', '2010-02-01 11:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5847351, 849924, 10785, '<td valign="top">This has a really bad background. It is cluttered from the print of the fabric. (Possibly a couch.) It is pretty out of focus and suffers from bad white balance. It''s very yellow probably from the tungsten lighting. The good thing is that you got a real nice centered composition.</td>', 'This has a really bad background. It is cluttered from the print of the fabric. (Possibly a couch.) It is pretty out of focus and suffers from bad white balance. It''s very yellow probably from the tungsten lighting. The good thing is that you got a real nice centered composition.', '2010-02-01 11:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5847389, 850572, 327, '<td valign="top">Bit too soft and a little bit flat. Sorry just doesn''t do much for me.</td>', 'Bit too soft and a little bit flat. Sorry just doesn''t do much for me.', '2010-02-01 12:10:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5847398, 851099, 49109, '<td valign="top">great idea and execution, bw works very well here. Jason?</td>', 'great idea and execution, bw works very well here. Jason?', '2010-02-01 12:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5847431, 851099, 69368, '<td valign="top">great idea. one of the best in challenge. Good luck!</td>', 'great idea. one of the best in challenge. Good luck!', '2010-02-01 12:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
