(5847484, 849924, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid I''m having to give this one a lowball vote, but I won''t do it without an explanation. The two biggest issues for me are that it''s somewhat out of focus, and the pattern of the cloth detracts from the main subject. Aside from that, it''s just a plain photo of a hand, and there''s just not much to grab my attention.</td>', 'I''m afraid I''m having to give this one a lowball vote, but I won''t do it without an explanation. The two biggest issues for me are that it''s somewhat out of focus, and the pattern of the cloth detracts from the main subject. Aside from that, it''s just a plain photo of a hand, and there''s just not much to grab my attention.', '2010-02-01 13:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5847489, 850480, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the soft tones, the ripples in the coffee, and also the soft vignette that frames the subject. It just comes together nicely. Very well done.</td>', 'I like the soft tones, the ripples in the coffee, and also the soft vignette that frames the subject. It just comes together nicely. Very well done.', '2010-02-01 13:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
