(5847495, 851264, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like this. The dancer looks slightly out of place on the street, yet comfortable in the environment. Could be a <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=32767" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">pawdrix</a> entry. If not, then please take that as a compliment.</td>', 'I like this. The dancer looks slightly out of place on the street, yet comfortable in the environment. Could be a  pawdrix entry. If not, then please take that as a compliment.', '2010-02-01 13:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
