(5847563, 849733, 113419, '<td valign="top">this image gives me the feeling that something just isn''t right :-(  makes me wonder what''s about to happen to this dog?  the title tells me it''s something being done out of kindness and love for the animal; the hand on the leash makes me think these two are old frineds - IMO you''ve done an excellent job with this and you''ve evoked alot of emotion</td>', 'this image gives me the feeling that something just isn''t right :-(  makes me wonder what''s about to happen to this dog?  the title tells me it''s something being done out of kindness and love for the animal; the hand on the leash makes me think these two are old frineds - IMO you''ve done an excellent job with this and you''ve evoked alot of emotion', '2010-02-01 13:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5847566, 850182, 113419, '<td valign="top">Great image!  The only thing I would suggest is a bit of a closer crop not having so much of the horses neck in the picture - perhaps croping out about 1/3 of what is showing now; the darker section as it keeps pulling my eye away from the hand</td>', 'Great image!  The only thing I would suggest is a bit of a closer crop not having so much of the horses neck in the picture - perhaps croping out about 1/3 of what is showing now; the darker section as it keeps pulling my eye away from the hand', '2010-02-01 13:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
