(5847580, 850562, 83313, '<td valign="top">A good and sweet image that any parent can identify with. The softness certainly suits the subject. I gave this a vote on the positive side of the scale, as it is a well done image. At the same time, however, it did not grab my attention or emotions in a way that made me put it high on the list. Perhaps a bit too soft, but I''m not totally sure.</td>', 'A good and sweet image that any parent can identify with. The softness certainly suits the subject. I gave this a vote on the positive side of the scale, as it is a well done image. At the same time, however, it did not grab my attention or emotions in a way that made me put it high on the list. Perhaps a bit too soft, but I''m not totally sure.', '2010-02-01 13:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
