(5847590, 851218, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice b/w tones. Strikes me as almost looking like a photo out of magazine ad from the 50''s or 60''s. (Like for a skin lotion, perhaps.) Perhaps a touch strong on the tone mapping, the skin patterns on the fleshy part of the person''s palm wants to draw my eye away from the flower. Got a vote on the positive side of the scale from me.</td>', 'Nice b/w tones. Strikes me as almost looking like a photo out of magazine ad from the 50''s or 60''s. (Like for a skin lotion, perhaps.) Perhaps a touch strong on the tone mapping, the skin patterns on the fleshy part of the person''s palm wants to draw my eye away from the flower. Got a vote on the positive side of the scale from me.', '2010-02-01 14:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5847599, 851189, 110023, '<td valign="top">I like the story this picture tells. Great DOF and the b/w was a good choice. ~8~ (After going through them all...yours is my top 3.) Bumping it up to a ~9~ now.</td>', 'I like the story this picture tells. Great DOF and the b/w was a good choice. ~8~ (After going through them all...yours is my top 3.) Bumping it up to a ~9~ now.', '2010-02-01 14:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
