(5849071, 851019, 74911, '<td valign="top">Good effect. Like the colors. Good play of tones. For some crazy reason, this hand looks to me like someone''s from India. Don''t ask me why. :) I may be wrong. But, just wanted to mention.</td>', 'Good effect. Like the colors. Good play of tones. For some crazy reason, this hand looks to me like someone''s from India. Don''t ask me why. :) I may be wrong. But, just wanted to mention.', '2010-02-02 13:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5849086, 851037, 10785, '<td valign="top">With this image you have technically met the challenge. I recognize this is a fingerprint... I think it''s such a huge fingerprint that CSI wouldn''t even need their complicated computers to match this to a suspect! I can''t believe you got that level of detail... what a piece of glass you must have! With all that said, I think you have gotten a bit too close here. The skin is kind of grey and dark. You did get some great textures here! I''ll bet you could posterize this and make a fine piece of graphic art to hang on the wall!</td>', 'With this image you have technically met the challenge. I recognize this is a fingerprint... I think it''s such a huge fingerprint that CSI wouldn''t even need their complicated computers to match this to a suspect! I can''t believe you got that level of detail... what a piece of glass you must have! With all that said, I think you have gotten a bit too close here. The skin is kind of grey and dark. You did get some great textures here! I''ll bet you could posterize this and make a fine piece of graphic art to hang on the wall!', '2010-02-02 13:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5849101, 850406, 10785, '<td valign="top">Here is another example of getting too close with the composition. It''s not very appealing but perhaps that is your point. I think the emphasis of the challenge was to create a photo with some form as opposed to photographing a piece of a human.</td>', 'Here is another example of getting too close with the composition. It''s not very appealing but perhaps that is your point. I think the emphasis of the challenge was to create a photo with some form as opposed to photographing a piece of a human.', '2010-02-02 14:01:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5849192, 850418, 114243, '<td valign="top">Talk about telling a story! great shot. If I was to pick on anything I would have liked to seen the ring in focus too, seeing as it really is the focus of the title. Minor flaw IMHO though. Fabulous!</td>', 'Talk about telling a story! great shot. If I was to pick on anything I would have liked to seen the ring in focus too, seeing as it really is the focus of the title. Minor flaw IMHO though. Fabulous!', '2010-02-02 15:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
