(5854116, 850697, 102019, '<td valign="top">This image clearly does not meet the challenge, which stated: <br/> <br/>"Your image should use as its PRIMARY subject some part/parts of the human body"<br/> <br/>Do you seriously expect us to believe that this dark and completely shadowed hand, stuck out into the middle of what would have been a beautiful landscape photo, is enough to make this image meet the challenge requirements?  If you didn''t have this particular challenge, would you ever have dreamed of taking a photograph like this?  The image looks like someone just stuck a hand in there, and without the context of this challenge, the existence of that hand is very confusing.  Therefore, this image is worthless.  We all know that you just stuck your hand in there to meet a challenge and for that reason, I cannot give you any marks for this.</td>', 'This image clearly does not meet the challenge, which stated:  "Your image should use as its PRIMARY subject some part/parts of the human body" Do you seriously expect us to believe that this dark and completely shadowed hand, stuck out into the middle of what would have been a beautiful landscape photo, is enough to make this image meet the challenge requirements?  If you didn''t have this particular challenge, would you ever have dreamed of taking a photograph like this?  The image looks like someone just stuck a hand in there, and without the context of this challenge, the existence of that hand is very confusing.  Therefore, this image is worthless.  We all know that you just stuck your hand in there to meet a challenge and for that reason, I cannot give you any marks for this.', '2010-02-05 12:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5854120, 849946, 102019, '<td valign="top">It''s really, really easy to take interesting and beautiful photographs of someone else''s art.  For that reason only, I cannot award high marks for this.</td>', 'It''s really, really easy to take interesting and beautiful photographs of someone else''s art.  For that reason only, I cannot award high marks for this.', '2010-02-05 12:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5854123, 850746, 102019, '<td valign="top">Something is off for me with the colours... I don''t like the border either.</td>', 'Something is off for me with the colours... I don''t like the border either.', '2010-02-05 12:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5854125, 851143, 102019, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the framing.  I would have preferred to see all 4 eyes, to be honest.</td>', 'I don''t like the framing.  I would have preferred to see all 4 eyes, to be honest.', '2010-02-05 12:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5854130, 850822, 102019, '<td valign="top">The first two times I looked at this, I didn''t really "see" it -- probably because it is too dark, and the lashes are not well defined.  Now that I have read the title, and I look closely at the eye lashes, I understand the point of the image.  I don''t know how you could have accomplished your goal, but my problem with this image is that the brightest part of it is the side of the face, and not the lash.  You really wanted to bring out the lashes, so you might have had to use some special lighting techniques to bring them out more clearly.</td>', 'The first two times I looked at this, I didn''t really "see" it -- probably because it is too dark, and the lashes are not well defined.  Now that I have read the title, and I look closely at the eye lashes, I understand the point of the image.  I don''t know how you could have accomplished your goal, but my problem with this image is that the brightest part of it is the side of the face, and not the lash.  You really wanted to bring out the lashes, so you might have had to use some special lighting techniques to bring them out more clearly.', '2010-02-05 12:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5854289, 850663, 114343, '<td valign="top">wow i love the intricate designs on her hands they are wonderful.</td>', 'wow i love the intricate designs on her hands they are wonderful.', '2010-02-05 15:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5854785, 850910, 74911, '<td valign="top">Very good choice of subjects</td>', 'Very good choice of subjects', '2010-02-05 23:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
