(5859026, 851236, 92545, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bvy:</b></div><hr/><i> Agh! The title... <br/> <br/>Cute shot anyway. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I am the worst when it comes to titles.  If this image were larger, though, you would notice that the reflection in her eye is of the light coming in a window.  The title served a double function in this case.  Thanks for leaving a comment.  :)</td>', 'Originally posted by bvy: Agh! The title...  Cute shot anyway.   I am the worst when it comes to titles.  If this image were larger, though, you would notice that the reflection in her eye is of the light coming in a window.  The title served a double function in this case.  Thanks for leaving a comment.  :)', '2010-02-08 13:47:54.000000', NULL, 0),
