(5859426, 851182, 67697, '<td valign="top">Seriously, I don''t know why, but I wondered if this was yours when voting.  My initial reaction is probably more deeper and spiritual than you intended.  What I saw was this symbolic image of one getting in touch with God. Just something about reaching out and touching the light made me think that. So go put in a good word with the Big Guy in the Sky for me, will ya?  :D</td>', 'Seriously, I don''t know why, but I wondered if this was yours when voting.  My initial reaction is probably more deeper and spiritual than you intended.  What I saw was this symbolic image of one getting in touch with God. Just something about reaching out and touching the light made me think that. So go put in a good word with the Big Guy in the Sky for me, will ya?  :D', '2010-02-08 17:09:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(5859434, 850809, 67697, '<td valign="top">I thought this was a clever interpretation of the theme.  But you knew the DNMC police were coming for ya, right?  One thing that really captured my attention was the make-up job on this mannequin.  I could not believe how much work someone put into the details lol.  I''m impressed with the MUA for this one!</td>', 'I thought this was a clever interpretation of the theme.  But you knew the DNMC police were coming for ya, right?  One thing that really captured my attention was the make-up job on this mannequin.  I could not believe how much work someone put into the details lol.  I''m impressed with the MUA for this one!', '2010-02-08 17:14:40.000000', NULL, 0),
