(5862133, 850302, 67697, '<td valign="top">I did like this one, and I thought his face showed a lot of character.  His eyes tho - what kind of editing was involved.  I was on the fence at first but the more I looked at it, the more I liked it.  I felt it served it''s purpose of making me stare and wonder.</td>', 'I did like this one, and I thought his face showed a lot of character.  His eyes tho - what kind of editing was involved.  I was on the fence at first but the more I looked at it, the more I liked it.  I felt it served it''s purpose of making me stare and wonder.', '2010-02-10 15:48:50.000000', NULL, 0),
