(5862144, 849733, 67697, '<td valign="top">Awww - I''m so glad to hear that someone will take her in, even tho she is old.  The older ones don''t often get that chance.  I think I''d actually like to see this without the vignette, although it does put more focus on the man''s hands.  Great story - hope she finds a home!</td>', 'Awww - I''m so glad to hear that someone will take her in, even tho she is old.  The older ones don''t often get that chance.  I think I''d actually like to see this without the vignette, although it does put more focus on the man''s hands.  Great story - hope she finds a home!', '2010-02-10 15:53:51.000000', NULL, 0),
